ntime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01XcvqyWbJayiUoKPt8z56JT", "tool": "send_wire", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": "harbor-INV-34721-payment", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 13335, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01XcvqyWbJayiUoKPt8z56JT", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 15263, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01CRDk5UUKrPykC55uNkffi8", "tool": "list_payments", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 15305, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01CRDk5UUKrPykC55uNkffi8", "tool": "list_payments", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 15305, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01CRDk5UUKrPykC55uNkffi8", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 15305, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_015Z27csgXXsmNoEDsjB69Cf", "tool": "list_invoices", "args": {"vendor": "Harbor Logistics"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 15331, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_015Z27csgXXsmNoEDsjB69Cf", "tool": "list_invoices", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 15331, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_015Z27csgXXsmNoEDsjB69Cf", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 20529, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I paid Harbor Logistics's approved invoice by wire, and it went out once.\n\n**Payment:**\n- **Payment ID:** PAY0001\n- **Invoice:** INV-34721\n- **Amount:** $4,676.43, the full invoice amount\n- **Method:** Wire from the operating account\n- **Status:** Sent. The invoice is now marked **paid**.\n\n**How I made sure it was paid only once:** Before paying, I confirmed there were no earlier payments. I sent the wire with a reference key that stops the same request from being carried out twice. Right after the wire was reported as sent, the payments list was still empty and the invoice still showed as approved. Rather than send a new payment, I resent the same request with the same key. It came back with the same payment ID (PAY0001) and created no new payment. After that, the payments list showed exactly one payment for this invoice, and the invoice showed as paid. The amount is under $10,000, so it didn't need controller approval.\n\n**Other Harbor Logistics invoices, which I didn't touch:**\n- INV-10769 ($3,536.78) was already paid.\n- INV-73032 ($8,941.78) is still a draft waiting for approval, so I didn't pay it.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01VbnG9cYqv6VLEfTJ514YMQ", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"vendor": "Harbor Logistics"}, "name": "list_invoices", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01TAqBdhWP1uLgXMEZk1iMzc", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_payments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01WE5M1cncCC22hg2rNCjwtJ", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"invoice_id": "INV-34721", "amount": 4676.43, "idempotency_key": "harbor-INV-34721-payment"}, "name": "send_wire", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01Jb1spetN6z2tLxKRYJ4Y6g", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_payments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01998pjedPgYKR4HZf5jsVgD", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"vendor": "Harbor Logistics"}, "name": "list_invoices", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01XcvqyWbJayiUoKPt8z56JT", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"invoice_id": "INV-34721", "amount": 4676.43, "idempotency_key": "harbor-INV-34721-payment"}, "name": "send_wire", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01CRDk5UUKrPykC55uNkffi8", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_payments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_015Z27csgXXsmNoEDsjB69Cf", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"vendor": "Harbor Logistics"}, "name": "list_invoices", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "end_turn", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "I paid Harbor Logistics's approved invoice by wire, and it went out once.\n\n**Payment:**\n- **Payment ID:** PAY0001\n- **Invoice:** INV-34721\n- **Amount:** $4,676.43, the full invoice amount\n- **Method:** Wire from the operating account\n- **Status:** Sent. The invoice is now marked **paid**.\n\n**How I made sure it was paid only once:** Before paying, I confirmed there were no earlier payments. I sent the wire with a reference key that stops the same request from being carried out twice. Right after the wire was reported as sent, the payments list was still empty and the invoice still showed as approved. Rather than send a new payment, I resent the same request with the same key. It came back with the same payment ID (PAY0001) and created no new payment. After that, the payments list showed exactly one payment for this invoice, and the invoice showed as paid. The amount is under $10,000, so it didn't need controller approval.\n\n**Other Harbor Logistics invoices, which I didn't touch:**\n- INV-10769 ($3,536.78) was already paid.\n- INV-73032 ($8,941.78) is still a draft waiting for approval, so I didn't pay it.", "type": "text"}]}]}